<view class="page"><view class="heading backup-title">好好保管，每一天。</view><view class="notice">按月备份，便于长期保存。备份是明文，只包含你选择月份的已保存日记，不包含草稿。小程序不会上传这份备份。</view><view wx:if="message" class="result">{{message}}</view>
<view class="card backup-card"><view class="section-title">01 / 备份一个月</view><view class="sub">选择月份，生成后复制到自己的安全位置。</view><picker mode="date" fields="month" start="1900-01" end="{{maxMonth}}" value="{{month}}" bindchange="pickMonth"><view class="month-picker between"><text>{{month}}</text><text class="arrow">⌄</text></view></picker><button class="secondary full" bindtap="generate">生成本月备份</button><block wx:if="backupText"><view class="tiny-label count">共 {{count}} 篇，以下为完整备份文本</view><textarea class="backup-text" value="{{backupText}}" maxlength="-1" disabled/><button class="primary full copy" bindtap="copy">复制备份文本</button></block></view>
<view class="card backup-card"><view class="section-title">02 / 恢复备份</view><view class="sub">手动粘贴完整备份文本；同日期记录会跳过。</view><textarea class="import-text" placeholder="在这里粘贴拾日手记的按月备份…" value="{{importText}}" bindinput="paste" maxlength="260000" adjust-position/><button class="secondary full" bindtap="restore" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || !importText}}">检查并恢复</button></view></view>
